        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Oleg Borisov, King Carolyne zu Sayn-Wittgenstein\n- Works: The Green Carriage, Scarlet Sails, Amphibian Man, The Adventures of Prince Florizel\n- Characters: Prince Florizel, Ivan\n- Topics: Soviet film, television adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1960s, Anastasiya Vertinskaya came to prominence through the films Scarlet Sails and Amphibian Man.\n- Oleg Borisov was the star of the film The Green Carriage.\n- Oleg Borisov also appeared in one of Anastasiya Vertinskaya’s early breakthrough works, appearing in Scarlet Sails.\n- In the television adaptation The Adventures of Prince Florizel, Oleg Borisov played Prince Florizel.\n- In The Adventures of Prince Florizel, King Carolyne zu Sayn-Wittgenstein summoned the character Ivan to distract Prince Florizel from his apparent madness.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
